// A surface opened at 0x0 -- gfx_width/gfx_height's own answer with no
// display (frame.id's own comment), so sys_present's size check agrees on
// its first import and goes on to read its second, the path sf_t_setup's
// 64x48 never reaches (it disagrees on the first and never gets that far).
sf_t_zero() {
  sf_open(0, 0);
} return void;
():() then sf_t_gw:(0)
():() then sf_t_gh:(0)
